<title>UK: McAlpine in bid talks with Raine - FT.</title>
<headline>McAlpine in bid talks with Raine - FT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>British construction group Alfred McAlpine Plc is in bid talks with housebuilding company Raine Plc, the Financial Times said on Saturday.</p>
<p>The newspaper said McAlpine was most interested in acquiring Raine's housing land holdings.</p>
<p>On Monday, Raine shares rose after the company said it was in talks with an unspecified firm which may lead to a takeover offer.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
